# A faction's official (Docs/Design/83-dialogue-trees.md, Phase 2): the missions board as choices, for a Chapter the
# faction knows (a mission's details are the work tree's, with the mission bound); a mission's goods or message handed
# in; what was taken, and giving it back (the work tree's mine); and the Chapter's standing: asked, a report paid for, a
# tithe. Entered from the wheel's "Ask for missions" (and a resident's "Any missions for us?").
#
# here.chapter: the player is of a Chapter (factions deal with no wolf alone). here.faction: its name. A mission locked
# by standing says why (#job.why#). The lines are talk concepts (dlg.official.<node>).

tree official
for here.official=yes
entry missions board

node board
say #work_offer# This is what #here.faction# wants done. | The board, then. This is what's wanted.
say[here.missions=0 priority=2] Nothing on the board today. Come back tomorrow.
say[here.chapter=no priority=5] #here.faction# deals with Chapters, not with one wolf alone.
mood formal
each job in here.missions max 4
choice Ask about: #job.title# (#job.reward#p) [here.chapter=yes topic.job_allowed=yes] locked "#job.why#" -> do open job
each job in here.deliveries max 2
choice #job.handover# [topic.job_ready=yes] locked "#job.why#" -> do deliver job.id ; then paid ; refused refused
choice About what I took on. [here.mine>0] -> do open mine
choice About our Chapter's standing... [here.chapter=yes] -> standing
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node standing
say What of it? | Ask, then. | Go on.
choice How does #here.faction# hold us? -> do standing ; then answer ; refused refused
choice I'll pay for a report (#here.report_fee#p). -> do buy_report ; then answer ; refused refused
choice A tithe, from our Chapter (#here.tithe_fee#p). -> do tithe ; then answer ; refused refused
choice Back to the board. -> board

node answer
say #topic.answer#
choice Anything else? -> board
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node paid
say #work_paid# #topic.job_paid.capitalize#. | #work_paid#
say[topic.job_paid=nothing priority=2] Done, and noted. There's no coin left in it today, I'm afraid.
mood pleased
choice Anything else? -> board
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node refused
say #topic.why# | Hm. #topic.why#
choice Anything else? -> board
choice Goodbye. -> bye

node bye
say #farewell#. | #farewell#, #address#.
end
